      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This is still an issue. For those of us who know about it, we can easily fix it. But for users who don't know about sub-parameters or how they linger and prevent upload even when unused, it can be a real headache that takes hours to figure out.\n\nSimple fix for the issue: If this error would appear, first check if the parameter is a sub-parameter that isn't in use by the menu item type. If true, just clear it and continue without an error.  Also check if the submenu field is assigned, if it is and the menu item isn't of type submenu, then clear that field and continue without an error.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
